[step] Required recessed fold-through TPU front lip. This Ø14.30 by 0.60 mm counterbore contains the receiver's Ø14.00 by 0.60 mm flexible lip flush within the permanent wall. Its Y83.115 floor and wall fore Y82.515 are separate fit planes. The next collar ramp starts 3 mm behind the floor, retaining the nominal rigid wall neck.
alternatives: Removing the recess puts the lip 0.60 mm in front of the wall, exceeding the seated cartridge's 0.25 mm gap by 0.35 mm where the moving dry passage is only Ø7.75. Deepening the recess reduces the 3 mm neck before the collar ramp. Extending the larger bore through the wall changes cuff confinement and X/Z location.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-front-top.step
