[sliver] These six faces bound the purchased outer valve-yoke approach pockets. Their 1.35 mm depth is the authored difference between the flank at |X|98.5 and the yoke approach at |X|99.85, including finite fore/aft and lower end planes. The current native windows retain those fitting boundaries; this is no printed-fit or strength acceptance.
alternatives: Filling the pocket enters the yoke approach. Cutting the entire flank to the pocket plane removes adjoining rail and mounting stock. Retain the finite purchased-part approach envelope.
